For the avoidance of doubt, the following are NOT Commercial Use, and are
permitted:

  (a) creating and distributing Content free of charge;
  (b) accepting donations, tips, subscriptions or advertising revenue for
      video, streaming or written coverage of the Software or of Content,
      including monetised videos and streams;
  (c) use by an individual for personal, educational, academic or research
      purposes; and
  (d) use by a non-profit organisation for non-commercial purposes.

The following ARE Commercial Use, and are prohibited without permission:

  (a) selling the Software, or charging any fee for access to it;
  (b) selling Content, or charging any fee for access to Content, where the
